{"uuid": "a07d3203-f2f2-4d5a-a6d2-44385d3f1af5", "message": "1000000110001010011010000010001010010110100101111010011011011101", "container": "Youth participation in politics is crucial for the development of a democratic society. It is important for young people to get involved in political processes and decision-making as they have unique perspectives and ideas. When youth engage in politics, they contribute to the formation of policies that directly affect them. Furthermore, their participation ensures that the needs and concerns of the younger generation are adequately addressed. By actively participating in politics, young people can take ownership of their future and shape the world they want to live in. Therefore, it is essential to encourage and empower youth to participate in politics and make their voices heard.", "encoded_message": "Youngsters involvement in government is critical for the growth of a self-governing community. This is essential for emerging citizens to become engaged in governmental activities and deliberation as they have distinctive viewpoints and insights. As adolescents participate in public life, they add to the creation of rules that immediately impact them. Moreover, their involvement assures that the wants and worries of the younger generation are adequately addressed. By actively participating in politics, young people can take ownership of their future and shape the world they want to live in. Therefore, it is essential to encourage and empower youth to participate in politics and make their voices heard.", "secret_key": [{"Youth": {"00": "Adolescents", "01": "Teens", "10": "Youngsters", "11": "Juveniles"}}, {"participation": {"00": "involvement", "01": "engagement", "10": "partaking", "11": "contribution"}}, {"in": {"0": "in", "1": "in"}}, {"politics": {"00": "government", "01": "governance", "10": "policy-making", "11": "political affairs"}}, {"is": {"0": "is", "1": "is"}}, {"crucial": {"00": "vital", "01": "critical", "10": "es